    {
      "key": "t3186492244edd7c0",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Choose a regulated platform or broker environment.</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Verify the legal entity, available instruments, and whether the copying feature comes from the broker or a third party.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">規制されたプラットフォームまたはブローカー環境を選択します。</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">法人、利用可能な手段、およびコピー機能がブローカーまたはサードパーティによるものであるかどうかを確認します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t08c055a5df81e73d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review the provider’s history.</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> Look beyond headline returns to drawdown, trading frequency, account age, open losses, leverage, and concentration.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">プロバイダーの履歴を確認します。</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">ヘッドラインのリターンだけでなく、ドローダウン、取引頻度、口座経過期間、未決済損失、レバレッジ、集中度などにも注目してください。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9ad05b53746c119b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The provider supplies trading activity. The subscriber carries the financial consequences in the subscriber account.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">プロバイダーは取引アクティビティを提供します。加入者は加入者アカウントの財務上の結果を負担します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3843a2924ee0e528",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Past performance cannot predict future results</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">過去の実績から将来の結果を予測することはできません</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t943a506c56367744",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Offers allocation controls on many platforms</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">多くのプラットフォームで割り当て制御を提供します</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2d1b59bca131871c",
