    },
    {
      "key": "tfcb6db3503a843b1",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Hands-Off Beginner</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">自分で取引操作を行いたくない初心者</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7fe53459f3903d93",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A learning trader can use provider histories to study entries, exits, and risk patterns. The danger is copying without forming an independent view.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">学習中のトレーダーは、プロバイダーの履歴を使用して、エントリー、エグジット、リスク パターンを研究できます。危険なのは、独立した見解を形成せずにコピーすることです。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6212b029ab4f2e0d",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Experienced Trader Seeking Another Decision Source</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">別の意思決定源を求める経験豊富なトレーダー</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6fe75a67c9ad0533",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">An experienced trader may use signals as one input, provided the copied strategy adds diversification instead of repeating existing exposure. Anyone considering copy trading forex positions should monitor the account rather than treating automation as passive or risk-free.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">経験豊富なトレーダーは、コピーされた戦略が既存のエクスポージャーを繰り返すのではなく多様化を追加する場合、シグナルを 一 つの入力として使用することがあります。外国為替ポジションのコピートレードを検討している人は、自動化を受動的またはリスクのないものとして扱うのではなく、アカウントを監視する必要があります。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4eb3726257e55e5e",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">How to Get Started Even If You Are Not Using Copy Trading Yet</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">まだコピートレードを使用していない場合でも始める方法</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta1c73b93c1f04913",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Learn order types, leverage, margin, and stop-loss mechanics.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">注文タイプ、レバレッジ、マージン、ストップロスの仕組みを学びます。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t5db01143a781282b",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Review provider statistics, especially drawdown and account age.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/copy-trading-and-social-trading-explained"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">プロバイダーの統計、特にドローダウンとアカウントの経過時間を確認します。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t0b665d4077b657d0",
